              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ahene yaho avasikari yavo, avenya koteveleriza Paolo vamuleka. Lwu munene wa avasikari oyo yamanya ndi Paolo nu Murumi, yatia ligali, kigira yaali naamuvohi ni minyororo.",
