              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku lialonda ku, munene wa avasikari va Varumi yenya kumanya kivuni kigira Avayuda ni vayaala Paolo. Yamuvoholora minyororo, nalaga avasaalisi vanene vi kiyaalo choosi kuvugana harara. Maku yavugula Paolo, naamusingiriza imbiri wavo.",
